      "message": "test: split CreateNewBlock_validity into separate test cases\n\nThe sub-tests ran as member functions on one shared chain, so each\nstarted from the state the previous one left behind and the caller had\nto patch `Tip()->nHeight` between them.\n\nMake them independent test cases, each mining the BLOCKINFO chain via\n`MineBlockInfoChain()`. The blocks use hardcoded nonces, so doing this\nonce per case is cheap.",
